&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-475446-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. SCP-5464 was, at that time, undergoing multiple tests conducted by the Foundation.&lt;/div&gt;
